# FinFamily — Cursor AI Rules

## Project Context
FinFamily is an Arabic RTL family asset management platform (شركة محاصة).
Stack: React + Vite, Tailwind CSS v4, Supabase, Recharts, React Hook Form + Zod.

## Coding Rules

### Language
- ALL UI text must be in Arabic — no English words visible to users
- Numbers and technical symbols (%, $, etc.) are allowed
- RTL layout: use `dir="rtl"` on root elements

### React
- Functional components only — no class components
- Use hooks (useState, useEffect, useCallback, useMemo)
- File naming: PascalCase for components (e.g., PortfolioCard.jsx)
- One component per file

### Styling
- Tailwind CSS v4 utility classes only — no inline styles
- Use `cn()` from `@/lib/utils` for conditional class merging
- Design tokens via CSS variables (--primary, --background, etc.)
- RTL-aware: prefer `ms-` / `me-` over `ml-` / `mr-`

### Data & Forms
- Forms: React Hook Form + Zod validation
- ALL monetary values stored as NUMERIC(18,4) in Supabase
- Currency: USD (reference) and SYP only
- ALWAYS validate that shares sum to 1 before saving

### Supabase
- All queries via `@/lib/supabase.js`
- RLS is ALWAYS enabled — never bypass
- Use `.select()` with explicit columns, never `*` in production queries
- Always handle errors with try/catch and display Arabic error messages

### File Structure
src/
  components/
    ui/          → Reusable atoms (Button, Input, Badge, etc.)
    layout/      → AppLayout, Sidebar, Header
    shared/      → Domain-shared components (ShareInput, CurrencyInput)
  pages/         → One folder per module (dashboard, transactions, etc.)
  hooks/         → Custom hooks (usePortfolios, useExchangeRate, etc.)
  lib/           → supabase.js, utils.js
  store/         → Zustand stores
  types/         → JSDoc type definitions

### Git Commits (English, Conventional Commits)
feat: add partner capital account view
fix: correct share validation for fractional denominators
refactor: extract CurrencyInput into shared component
chore: update supabase types

## Critical Business Rules
1. Sum of shares for any entity MUST equal 1 — enforce before every save
2. Every monetary transaction stores: amount + currency + exchange_rate_at_time
3. USD is the reference currency for all reports
4. RLS must be active on every table — single authenticated user
